WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.194 --> 00:00:04.384
The leak reveals that House of the Dragon
will feature one of the most legendary brother

00:00:04.384 --> 00:00:09.964
vs brother duel in Westeros history when twin
brothers who deeply loved each other also

00:00:09.964 --> 00:00:15.594
fought each other because one of them sided
with Aegon and the other with Rhaenyra. A

00:00:15.594 --> 00:00:20.984
leaked audition tape was recently posted and
(shortly after deleted) featuring two twin

00:00:20.984 --> 00:00:27.384
actors reading the parts of legendary Cargyll
brothers, Arryk and Erryk. In this leaked

00:00:27.384 --> 00:00:32.714
audition tape, actors who are identical twins
read a scene in which their characters Arryk

00:00:32.714 --> 00:00:38.474
and Erryk discuss the rights of Prince Aegon,
soon to become King Aegon. Their dialogue

00:00:38.474 --> 00:00:43.943
and physical gestures suggest that they are
guarding the prince while he visits a brothel,

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:50.083
something for which Aegon was very known.
Erryk is disturbed by Prince Aegon's behavior

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:56.344
and wonders aloud what sort of King for Westeros
Aegon will be if this is how he acts as a

00:00:56.344 --> 00:01:01.164
Prince while Arryk insists that all men are
equally bad and that they should accept him

00:01:01.164 --> 00:01:07.423
for what he is. Arryk says that the Hand of
the King, Ser Otto Hightower who is also Aegon's

00:01:07.423 --> 00:01:12.514
grandfather, will keep him in check,
but Erryk still doesn't like the idea of Aegon

00:01:12.514 --> 00:01:17.734
ruling Westeros. Anyways, that's the leaked
audition tape that spoiled a huge plot in

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:23.834
House of the Dragon. So who are these Arryk
and Erryk brothers? They are twin brothers

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:28.893
and both are members of the Kingsguard under
King Viserys, but they fought on opposite

00:01:28.893 --> 00:01:34.264
sides of the Dance of the Dragons and ended
their lives with a legendary duel which inspired

00:01:34.264 --> 00:01:39.814
many songs in Westeros. In this leak, Erryk
doubts that Prince Aegon will make a good

00:01:39.814 --> 00:01:45.864
King, foreshadowing his allegiance to Rhaenyra
over Aegon, while Arryk is determined to stand

00:01:45.864 --> 00:01:52.313
by the prince, regardless of his faults because
he thinks he is the rightful heir. Ser Arryk

00:01:52.313 --> 00:01:57.313
and Ser Erryk Cargyll are knights from House
Cargyll. They are members of the Kingsguard

00:01:57.313 --> 00:02:02.953
during the reign of King Viserys I Targaryen.
But when the king dies and his son and daughter

00:02:02.953 --> 00:02:08.514
each declare themselves the rightful rulers
of Westeros, the Cargyll brothers are divided

00:02:08.514 --> 00:02:15.953
for the first time. Arryk ends up siding with
Aegon Targaryen and Erryk with Rhaenyra Targaryen.

00:02:15.953 --> 00:02:21.343
According to Septon Eustace, Arryk found Prince
Daemon and Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen in

00:02:21.343 --> 00:02:27.264
bed together, a few months after the tourney
to celebrate King Viserys's and Queen Alicent's

00:02:27.264 --> 00:02:33.464
fifth anniversary in 111 AC, which is why
he thinks Princess Rhaenyra is not much better

00:02:33.464 --> 00:02:39.944
than Aegon. Meanwhile, in 120 AC King Viserys
I Targaryen made Erryk the sworn shield of

00:02:39.944 --> 00:02:46.974
Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen, replacing Ser
Harwin Strong. After the death of Viserys,

00:02:46.974 --> 00:02:52.414
Erryk followed Ser Steffon Darklyn and Ser
Lorent Marbrand in siding with the blacks

00:02:52.414 --> 00:02:57.654
and joined the Queensguard of Rhaenyra. His
brother Arryk, however, supported Rhaenyra's

00:02:57.654 --> 00:03:04.063
rival, King Aegon II Targaryen and the greens.
After the coronation of Aegon in the Dragonpit,

00:03:04.063 --> 00:03:09.453
Arryk led the king into the throne room of
the Red Keep. Rhaenyra's coronation occured

00:03:09.453 --> 00:03:14.613
shortly after on Dragonstone as Prince Daemon
placed the Old King's crown on the head of

00:03:14.613 --> 00:03:19.643
his wife, proclaiming her Rhaenyra of House
Targaryen, First of Her Name, Queen of the

00:03:19.643 --> 00:03:24.853
Andals, the Rhoynar, and the First Men. When
word of Rhaenyra's coronation reached the

00:03:24.853 --> 00:03:30.844
Red Keep the next day, Aegon was furious.
Cooler heads on the green council wished to

00:03:30.844 --> 00:03:37.504
parley. So Grand Maester Orwycle was dispatched
across Blackwater Bay under a peace banner,

00:03:37.504 --> 00:03:42.523
leading a retinue that included Ser Arryk
Cargyll of the Kingsguard, in something that

00:03:42.523 --> 00:03:48.404
ended up being an unsuccessful attempt to
reconcile the rival Targaryens. The terms

00:03:48.404 --> 00:03:54.553
offered by the king were generous. If Queen
Rhaenyra would acknowledge him as king, Aegon

00:03:54.553 --> 00:03:59.564
would confirm her in possession of Dragonstone
and allow the island and castle to pass to

00:03:59.564 --> 00:04:05.413
her son upon her death. Pardons would be granted
to all lords and knights, including Erryk,

00:04:05.413 --> 00:04:11.284
who had conspired against him. Rhaenyra heard
these terms in silence, Erryk by her side

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:16.404
as well as most of the blacks, then asked
Grand Maester Orwyle (who presented her these

00:04:16.404 --> 00:04:22.963
terms on Aegon's behalf) if he remembers her
father King Viserys who named her as his heir

00:04:22.963 --> 00:04:28.094
and successor, not Aegon. Grand Maester replied
that he remembers that the King named her

00:04:28.094 --> 00:04:31.323
his heir.
Rhaenyra nodded and said "with your own tongue

00:04:31.323 --> 00:04:36.763
you admit I am your lawful queen.
Why then do you serve my half-brother Aegon,

00:04:36.763 --> 00:04:44.423
the pretender?" Orwyle gave a long reply citing
the Andal Law and the Great Council of 101.

00:04:44.423 --> 00:04:49.094
The answer did not satisfy Rhaenyra.
"A Grand Maester should know the law and serve

00:04:49.094 --> 00:04:53.694
it" she told him. "You are not Grand Maester,
and you only bring shame and dishonor to that

00:04:53.694 --> 00:04:59.173
chain you wear". As Orwyle protested, Ser
Erryk stripped his chain of office from his

00:04:59.173 --> 00:05:05.663
neck and forced him to his knees while the
princess bestowed the chain upon her own Measter.

00:05:05.663 --> 00:05:11.073
As she sent Orwyle and Ser Arryk back to King's
Landing, Rhaenyra said "Tell my half-brother

00:05:11.073 --> 00:05:16.303
that I will have my throne, or I will have
his head." Many years after the Targaryen

00:05:16.303 --> 00:05:22.443
civil war was done, the singer Luceon of Tarth
would compose a sad ballad called "Farewell,

00:05:22.443 --> 00:05:27.314
My Brother" that is still sung to this day.
The song tells a story of the last meeting

00:05:27.314 --> 00:05:32.963
between Ser Arryk and his twin Ser Erryk Cargyll,
as Orwyle's party was boarding the ship that

00:05:32.963 --> 00:05:39.174
would carry them back to King's Landing. Ser
Arryk had sworn his sword to Aegon, Ser Erryk

00:05:39.174 --> 00:05:45.435
to Rhaenyra. In that song, each brother tries
to persuade the other to change sides. Upon

00:05:45.435 --> 00:05:50.314
realization that each failed, they exchange
declarations of love and go their separate

00:05:50.314 --> 00:05:55.934
ways, knowing that when they meet again, they
will meet as enemies. Upon a few following

00:05:55.934 --> 00:06:01.603
events, Arryk will go on a mission to Dragonstone
where he will meet and fight his brother Erryk

00:06:01.603 --> 00:06:06.904
to death. It all started when Rhaenyra's second
son, Lucerys, flew on his dragon to Storm's

00:06:06.904 --> 00:06:13.293
End to gain an alliance with House Baratheon,
but Aegon II's brother Aemond flew to Storm's

00:06:13.293 --> 00:06:19.883
End at the same time to pursue the same goal,
riding the older dragon Vhagar. Storm's End

00:06:19.883 --> 00:06:27.013
subsequently supported Aegon II. Aemond, riding
Vhagar, killed Luke over Shipbreaker Bay as

00:06:27.013 --> 00:06:31.833
he attempted to leave after failing to gain
Lord Baratheon's allegiance.

00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:37.073
This then led to Rhaenyra and Daemon taking
revenge against Aegon and sending Blood and

00:06:37.073 --> 00:06:42.743
Cheese, nicknames of two men who sneaked into
the Red Keep and killed his son. A son for

00:06:42.743 --> 00:06:48.264
a son. This then led to King Aegon's desire
to avenge the killing of his heir by Blood

00:06:48.264 --> 00:06:54.374
and Cheese by means of an attack on Dragonstone,
descending on the island citadel on dragonback

00:06:54.374 --> 00:07:00.033
to seize or slay Rhaenyra and her sons.
It took all of the green council to change

00:07:00.033 --> 00:07:04.063
his strategy. Ser Criston Cole urged a different
course.

00:07:04.063 --> 00:07:09.624
"Rhaenyra had made use of stealth and tracheary
to kill his son", Cole said to Aegon, "so

00:07:09.624 --> 00:07:14.993
let's do the same" he continued. "We will
pay the princess back in her own bloody coin"

00:07:14.993 --> 00:07:19.193
he told the king.
The instrument the Lord Commander of the Kingsguard

00:07:19.193 --> 00:07:25.534
chose for the king's vengeance was his Sworn
Brother, Ser Arryk Cargyll. Many fishermen

00:07:25.534 --> 00:07:31.384
arrive daily on Dragonstone so it would be
a simple thing to deliver Arryk to the island.

00:07:31.384 --> 00:07:36.473
From there he would make his own way to the
queen, pretending to be Ser Erryk for Arryk

00:07:36.473 --> 00:07:42.814
and Erryk were twins, identical in all respects;
not even their fellow members of the Kingsguard

00:07:42.814 --> 00:07:48.124
could tell the two apart. Ser Arryk should
be able to move freely at Dragonstone, Ser

00:07:48.124 --> 00:07:54.044
Criston suggested as any guards to encounter
him would surely mistake him for his brother.

00:07:54.044 --> 00:07:58.924
After King Aegon gave this mission a green
light, Lord Commander of Aegon's Kingsguard

00:07:58.924 --> 00:08:05.544
and therefore Arryk's Lord Commander as well,
Ser Criston, ordered Arryk to infiltrate Dragonstone,

00:08:05.544 --> 00:08:10.504
although it's disputed whether his mission
was to kill Rhaenyra or her children or even

00:08:10.504 --> 00:08:16.674
both. Ser Arryk did not undertake his mission
happily. He thought this to be dishonorable

00:08:16.674 --> 00:08:22.694
for a knight of the Kingsguard. Septon Eustace
says that Arryk visited the Red Keep's sept

00:08:22.694 --> 00:08:28.735
on the night he was to sail for Dragonsone,
to pray for forgiveness to Mother Above. Yet

00:08:28.735 --> 00:08:35.054
as Kingsguard, sworn to obey king and commander,
he had no choice in honor, but to do as commanded

00:08:35.054 --> 00:08:41.814
or die trying. Ser Arryk came ashore Dragonstone,
donned his armor and white cloak, and had

00:08:41.814 --> 00:08:46.874
no trouble gaining entrance to the castle
in disguise of his twin brother. Deep in the

00:08:46.874 --> 00:08:51.713
hearth of Dragonstone, as he was making his
way to the royal apartments where Rhaenyra

00:08:51.713 --> 00:08:57.453
and her sons were, the gods brought Arryk
face-to-face with his brother Ser Erryk who

00:08:57.453 --> 00:09:02.634
knew at once what his brother's presence meant.
Ser Erryk said "I love you brother" as he

00:09:02.634 --> 00:09:08.434
drew his blade, and Ser Arryk replied "I love
you too, brother" as he drew his own. The

00:09:08.434 --> 00:09:13.644
twins battled for the best part of an hour.
The clash of steel on steel woke half of the

00:09:13.644 --> 00:09:18.394
Queen Rhaenyra's court, but all they could
do was stand by helplessly and watch, for

00:09:18.394 --> 00:09:23.153
no man could tell which brother was which.
In the end, Ser Arryk and Ser Erryk dealt

00:09:23.153 --> 00:09:29.353
each other mortal wounds, and died in one
another's arms with tears upon their cheeks.

00:09:29.353 --> 00:09:35.744
That's the story of the legendary Cargyll
brothers. When I say Targaryen fought Targaryen,

00:09:35.744 --> 00:09:39.684
dragon fought dragon, and brother fought brother
during the Targaryen civil war, I mean it

00:09:39.684 --> 00:09:44.903
and you will see it for yourself in 2022 on
HBO. Thank you so much for watching! If you

00:09:44.903 --> 00:09:51.413
enjoyed this video please give it a big thumbs
up and I hope to see you in the next one.

